    "text": "roanokebeacon.com\nwebsite\nPlymouth\nSigns go missing as election season heats up\nBy Dale-RB,\n17 hours agoA handful of election campaign signs sprinkled the Plymouth landscape in the last days of September. Along with the signs came reports that some of the yard signs mysteriously disappeared afterward. Signs for mayoral candidate Mark Sexton and Town Council candidate Gale O’Neil were the first to pop up in...\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nThe KLC Journal\n·\nuser · 687 followers\nDavid Heitz\n·\nuser · 29.8K followers\nThree Denver council members put homeless family in hotel, cop buys unhoused man breakfast\nDenver City Council members Serena Gonzales Guttierez, Sarah Parady and Shontel Lewis combined forces after Monday’s meeting and helped a family that had been told no shelter was available, Housekeys Action Network Denver posted Tuesday on social media.\nDenver, CO ·22d",
